1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:55,630
Zhuque Zi doesn't control the Cultivation Planet Crystal yet.

25
00:01:57,640 --> 00:02:00,120
And Situ still needs time to possess his new body...

26
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:01,880
Once he awakens,

27
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:04,480
I will retrieve both my soul strand and Wan'er's.

28
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:07,720
Now that planet Suzaku is in chaos,

29
00:02:07,720 --> 00:02:09,480
it's no longer suitable for cultivation.

30
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:12,720
But if I'm heading to planet Tian Yun,

31
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:14,270
I'll need to prepare thoroughly.

32
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:19,720
There is also the problem of Tuo Sen from the Land of the Ancient God...

33
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:22,630
This blood contains a trace of Ancient God blood

34
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:25,910
so it's perfect for my Ancient God body.

35
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:29,430
But this amount is far from enough...

36
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:33,640
The person I found under the Corpse Sect begging for help

37
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:36,840
must be the founding Ancestor of the Giant Demon Clan.

38
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:39,150
Perhaps I should take this chance to visit the Corpse Sect

39
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:41,040
and see if I can get more.

40
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:57,870
Brother Wang,

41
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,190
it’s been a while.

42
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:02,230
Do you still remember me ?

43
00:03:02,920 --> 00:03:03,710
Brother Zhou,

44
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:05,990
long time no see.

45
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,800
It's wine from back then,

46
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,150
my last jar.

47
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,230
This wine is still the same as back then

48
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:24,110
and so are the people.

49
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:25,910
As the saying goes:

50
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:29,040
"Things remain the same, but it's the people that change."

51
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:29,040
"Spring at Wuling", poem by Li Qingzhao

52
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:33,120
But it seems that the people remain the same, and it's the things that have changed.

53
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,310
Since the Four Sect Alliance,

54
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:38,710
Brother Wang has gained a mighty reputation on planet Suzaku.

55
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:41,630
Let's toast to you.

56
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:48,560
Brother Zhou has a good master guarding him.

57
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,680
I'm sure that you also will

58
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,030
achieve great feats.

59
00:03:58,720 --> 00:03:59,510
Brother Wang,

60
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:02,190
I have another toast for you.

61
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:04,800
Thank you for killing Li Yuanfeng,

62
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,400
sealing Xue Yue,

63
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:08,400
and avenging the Four Sect Alliance.

64
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:13,710
Brother Zhou,

65
00:04:14,480 --> 00:04:16,310
since you were waiting for me,

66
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:19,000
please speak your mind.

67
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,710
It all began when

68
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:28,510
the Forsaken Immortal Clan activated the Reincarnation Tree.

69
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:32,160
East of the
Suzaku Continent

70
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:42,320
Mei Ji
Third Ancestor of the
Forsaken Immortal Clan
9-leaf Shaman

71
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,600
Old Thief,

72
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:45,800
don't think that destroying a Reincarnation Tree

73
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:48,550
will reverse the decline of your country of Suzaku !

74
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:54,230
Early stage Ascendant

75
00:04:54,840 --> 00:04:56,990
yet you bark like a dog !

76
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,310
My clan

77
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:09,230
will win this war for sure !

78
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:12,710
Don't be so arrogant, Junior.

79
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:28,880
Yunque Zi
Second Ancestor of the
Forsaken Immortal Clan
Middle stage Ascendant

80
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:33,630
Senior Brother,

81
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:36,430
long time no see.

82
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:45,320
Thank you for saving me, Second Ancestor.

83
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:48,510
Greetings, Second Ancestor.

84
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:50,990
Greetings, Second Ancestor.

85
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:59,590
Should I call you Yunque Zi

86
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:02,390
or Second Ancestor of the Forsaken Immortal Clan ?

87
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:04,560
Titles are meaningless.

88
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:06,480
Senior Brother can call me however he likes.

89
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:09,350
You’re heavily injured.

90
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:11,110
If you fight me now

91
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:13,230
you will only accelerate your death.

92
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:17,150
Then why don't you kill me now !?

93
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:19,390
"Don't fight a desperate enemy,

94
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:21,560
always leave an escape route open."

95
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:21,560
Note: "The art of War", Sun Tzu

96
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:23,910
My Forsaken Immortal Clan

97
00:06:24,080 --> 00:06:26,710
has a deal for you.

98
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:29,310
You know better than anyone

99
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:32,230
that the defeat of Suzaku is inevitable.

100
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:35,470
But my Forsaken Immortal Clan

101
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:38,390
is willing to split planet Suzaku in half with you.

102
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:40,110
We will rule separately

103
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:41,790
without interfering.

104
00:06:42,520 --> 00:06:44,230
What do you think ?

105
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:49,510
Despicable...

106
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:52,470
We will meet in 3 months

107
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:54,310
at Mount Suzaku.

108
00:06:55,040 --> 00:07:00,110
My Forsaken Immortal Clan will wait for your decision.

109
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:10,750
Find a cold, dark place

110
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,910
and recover quickly.

111
00:07:26,520 --> 00:07:29,640
First Ancestor of the
Forsaken Immortal Clan
11-leaf Shaman

112
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:23,710
Do you remember

113
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:26,790
how many clansmen we sacrificed

114
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:30,790
to break the seal and send you into the country of Suzaku ?

115
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:34,030
You could’ve killed him,

116
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:36,310
why did you let him go !?

117
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:40,830
He has the Cultivation Planet Heart

118
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:43,630
and can control the Cultivation Planet Crystal.

119
00:07:43,840 --> 00:07:47,550
Even if the Second Suzaku sealed the crystal,

120
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:50,950
he can still destroy it.

121
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:54,430
Even if his soul strand is inside it,

122
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:57,390
if you try to kill him

123
00:07:57,960 --> 00:08:01,470
he will crush the crystal before his life ends

124
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:06,710
and billions of our people below 9-Leaf

125
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:09,550
will die with him.

126
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:16,470
I had secretly raised 4 candidates.

127
00:08:16,760 --> 00:08:19,910
No matter the one he chose as successor,

128
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:23,550
we could've weakened Suzaku even more

129
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,390
and ensured our clan’s prosperity !

130
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:30,590
But Ancestor Xu and you were too impatient

131
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:34,310
and ruined the plan I painstakingly laid out.

132
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:36,750
It was all for nothing !

133
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:40,550
Why did you give him 3 months ?

134
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:42,710
What’s the point ?

135
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,470
3 months

136
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:48,750
is enough to subdue his last allies

137
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:51,110
and make him face reality !

138
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:53,430
To keep planet Suzaku,

139
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:56,310
he must surrender the Cultivation Planet Heart.

140
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:57,950
Remember,

141
00:08:58,280 --> 00:09:01,350
we never wanted to kill the Suzaku.

142
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,270
We want our clan

143
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:07,950
to freely live on the surface of this planet again.

144
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:10,070
Why are you so sure

145
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,710
he will agree to your plan ?

146
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:16,230
In order to become the Suzaku,

147
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:18,950
he killed his own master.

148
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:21,550
Such a person

149
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:24,910
will never accept

150
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:27,510
that he has lost everything.

151
00:09:28,760 --> 00:09:30,270
In the following months

152
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:34,030
Yunque Zi and the others besieged the Earth Soul Sect

153
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,910
and killed its Ascendant Ancestor.

154
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:39,190
They crippled the Heavenly Jade Sect Leader, Chu Yunfei,

155
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:42,040
and forced him to flee planet Suzaku.

156
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:45,230
The rank 5 country of Suiboku

157
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:46,190
has fallen

158
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:48,110
The rank 5 country of Mudan

159
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:48,990
has fallen.

160
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:50,310
The rank 5 country of Qin

161
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:51,310
has fallen.

162
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:53,750
Among planet Suzaku’s cultivators,

163
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,510
Zhuque Zi

164
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:57,870
is the only remaining Ascendant.

165
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,910
And very soon,

166
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:04,310
the Ancestral Spirits will bloom again.

167
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:07,110
When that happens,

168
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:08,910
Zhuque Zi

169
00:10:09,520 --> 00:10:11,510
will have no chance left.

170
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:16,870
Everything unfolded as Senior Yunque Zi predicted.

171
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:20,280
So you were also chosen by Yunque Zi.

172
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,350
Of the four of us,

173
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,110
I only know three.

174
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:28,200
I possess Azure Dragon bloodline and the Emotionless domain.

175
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:30,750
Zi Xin was once Qian Feng’s cauldron

176
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:33,030
and has karma with him.

177
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,510
Senior Yunque Zi

178
00:10:35,640 --> 00:10:39,830
wanted us to counter Zhuque Zi’s 2 disciples.

179
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,510
The third person

180
00:10:43,520 --> 00:10:44,750
is you.

181
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:47,710
He said if you’re willing

182
00:10:47,920 --> 00:10:49,110
you can meet him.

183
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:50,750
That way,

184
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:54,710
he can teach you the true use of the Staw Hat.

185
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:02,910
Tell Yunque Zi

186
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:06,030
that I won’t meet him.

187
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:13,630
Fine.

188
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:15,310
Will you give me

189
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:17,590
this jar of wine ?

190
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:20,390
I once fought Liu Mei

191
00:11:20,520 --> 00:11:21,880
and recorded her domain

192
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:23,350
in this jade slip.

193
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:30,920
Whether you read it or not

194
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:32,350
is your choice.

195
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:37,910
Thank you.

196
00:11:54,160 --> 00:11:57,280
Corpse Sect
Country of Zhao

197
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:05,640
Li Qingping
Corpse Sect Leader
Late stage Nascent Soul

198
00:12:05,760 --> 00:12:07,200
This Divine Sense…

199
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,840
a Soul Transformation cultivator ?

200
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:10,110
Interesting.

201
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:10,720
Cao Yidou's Origin Soul
Planet Tian Yun's Mile Sect
Middle stage Soul Formation

202
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:12,870
A Soul Formation Origin Soul

203
00:12:13,520 --> 00:12:16,070
is able to detect my presence.

204
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,760
Please spare me, Senior !

205
00:12:18,160 --> 00:12:20,040
My sect's cultivation method

206
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:21,600
is highly sensitive to Divine Sense.

207
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:24,390
Which sect are you from ?

208
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:26,630
Junior...

209
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:28,150
Junior's name is Cao Yidou,

210
00:12:28,400 --> 00:12:30,480
I'm a disciple of the Mile Sect on planet Tian Yun.

211
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:32,360
Planet Tian Yun ?

212
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:34,760
Why is someone from Tian Yun

213
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:36,510
on planet Suzaku ?

214
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:37,710
Senior,

215
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,150
my body was destroyed

216
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:41,350
so I bought a new one from the Corpse Sect.

217
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:43,350
But I didn't have enough spirit stones

218
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:45,030
for the prices on Tian Yun.

219
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:47,120
My only choice was to settle for

220
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:48,880
a cheaper option like planet Suzaku.

221
00:12:49,760 --> 00:12:51,110
What do you know

222
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:53,360
about planet Tian Yun ?

223
00:12:53,560 --> 00:12:55,510
Junior grew up there

224
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:57,630
and knows every detail !

225
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,190
If Senior plans to go,

226
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:00,510
I can guide you.

227
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:02,430
Very well.

228
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:05,310
Be my servant for 100 years

229
00:13:05,920 --> 00:13:06,910
and in return

230
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:10,190
I’ll give you a Soul Transformation body.

231
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:12,280
This person seems strong.

232
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:13,680
It's better to gamble

233
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:15,110
than to provoke his wrath.

234
00:13:16,520 --> 00:13:17,230
Cao Yidou

235
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:18,630
greets Master.

236
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,950
It's still here...

237
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:32,390
His bloodline is the purest

238
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:34,230
and he's at least Ascendant.

239
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:37,030
If I can take his blood,

240
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:39,710
it'll benefit me greatly.

241
00:13:40,560 --> 00:13:41,310
Fog, disperse.

242
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:43,750
Little friend,

243
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:45,110
save me !

244
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:46,550
Save me !

245
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:55,480
Seal !

246
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:58,830
This Giant Demon body

247
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:01,160
can't be pierced by my celestial sword

248
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:02,750
but can be hurt by these vines.

249
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:04,990
I’ll use them to draw blood.

250
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:07,710
Little friend,

251
00:14:08,320 --> 00:14:09,990
if you free me

252
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:12,910
and I’ll give you the main artifact of the Giant Demon Clan !

253
00:14:21,760 --> 00:14:24,400
Lei Ji
Giant Demon Clan branch leader

254
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:17,470
This is…

255
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:19,600
a hint of Ancient God blood.

256
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:21,350
His blood is indeed useful to me.

257
00:14:21,640 --> 00:14:22,510
Little friend,

258
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,630
if you accept to free me,

259
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:26,790
I’ll give you my clan’s strongest artifact:

260
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:28,390
the Heaven-Splitting Metal.

261
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:31,310
I will order the Giant Demon Clan of Suzaku

262
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:33,110
to obey you forever !

263
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:35,910
As long as you free me from this place,

264
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:38,630
I’ll even become your mount !

265
00:14:40,040 --> 00:14:41,030
Little friend,

266
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:43,830
a Giant Demon’s body

267
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:45,990
is like a star compass.

268
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:48,510
It's able to traverse places

269
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:51,470
ordinary cultivators cannot.

270
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:55,240
The old monsters of the Cultivation Alliance

271
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:57,510
all want Giant Demons as mounts !

272
00:14:57,920 --> 00:14:59,830
Once we pledge loyalty,

273
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:01,310
we never betray.

274
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:02,670
Free me

275
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:05,350
and I’ll serve you !

276
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:07,710
Since you took my blood,

277
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:09,230
you must need it.

278
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:10,950
My marrow holds

279
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:13,110
even more essence than my blood.

280
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:15,240
I will teach you how to extract it !

281
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:17,030
Something's wrong.

282
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:23,550
First, he baited me with promises.

283
00:15:24,400 --> 00:15:26,950
Then, he stalled with explanations.

284
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:28,710
Losing his blood

285
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:29,790
should weaken him

286
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:32,190
and make his escape harder.

287
00:15:32,920 --> 00:15:35,040
But he is ignoring it...

288
00:15:35,160 --> 00:15:37,950
This isn't how someone that needs help would act.

289
00:15:39,160 --> 00:15:40,190
Could it be...

290
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:41,790
Who are you ?

291
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:45,960
I'm Lei Ji, the leader of our branch of the Giant Demon Clan !

292
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:47,870
I once killed 3 9-Leaf Shamans

293
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:50,310
of the Forsaken Immortal Clan.

294
00:15:50,880 --> 00:15:53,630
I was then chased by an 11-Leaf Warrior

295
00:15:54,040 --> 00:15:55,920
and ended up captured by the Corpse Sect

296
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:57,480
and then sealed here.

297
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:58,510
If you free me,

298
00:15:59,280 --> 00:16:02,270
every Giant Demon Clan member on Suzaku

299
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:03,950
will pledge themselves to you !

300
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:09,630
Little friend,

301
00:16:09,640 --> 00:16:10,230
you…

302
00:16:10,520 --> 00:16:11,550
I won't save you.

303
00:16:12,400 --> 00:16:14,550
Saving you doesn't benefit me.

304
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:16,830
But if I leave you here,

305
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:19,150
I can come later to harvest more blood.

306
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:21,030
Which is much better.

307
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:22,590
Senior Lei Ji,

308
00:16:23,160 --> 00:16:24,430
farewell.

309
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:27,200
He didn't want me to free him

310
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:29,360
but he was luring me into drawing more blood.

311
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:31,150
If I had continued,

312
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:33,310
it would've awakened his power

313
00:16:33,920 --> 00:16:35,510
and help him escape.

314
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:38,710
If he had stayed half an incense stick of time

315
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:40,790
and continued to draw my blood,

316
00:16:40,920 --> 00:16:43,350
it would have lured this vine inside my body

317
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:45,590
and allowed my soul to escape !

318
00:16:46,160 --> 00:16:49,270
I REFUSE TO ACCEPT THIS !

319
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:10,630
I didn't expect that in this cold and gloomy Corpse Sect

320
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:14,830
I would find such a delicious smell.

321
00:17:20,520 --> 00:17:24,510
A Soul Transformation that hasn't tasted a woman ?

322
00:17:25,320 --> 00:17:27,510
A rare delicacy...

323
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:35,590
Little cultivator,

324
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:37,790
how about we…

325
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:40,630
experience the beauty of life ?

326
00:17:45,370 --> 00:20:21,150
There is some debate among the fans about the real cultivation level of Yunque Zi. To be clear, the animation studio went with 10-Leaf Shaman in the character card but I don't think this is correct because:

n°1: Yunque Zi lived his early life infiltrated in the country of Suzaku and had to become a regular cultivator for that. Yunque Zi also doesn't display any tattoos.
n°2: Yunque Zi has a domain whereas the Forsaken Immortal Clan members don't have one with their method of cultivation (it's the same as Ancient Gods having a different cultivation system and thus not having domains).
n°3: Wang Lin explicitly says he is Middle stage Ascendant in the novel.

Counter-arguments:

n°1: Even if lore-wise Forsaken Immortal Clan members shouldn't have domains, there is a second example of one (which is Mei Ji, the Third Ancestor of the Forsaken Immortal clan that we see at the end of the episode with her charm domain).
n°2: There is a single dialogue where Yunque Zi mentions high level shamans and he includes himself in them.

327
00:18:02,090 --> 00:18:05,390
To let go of the consequences of my actions

328
00:18:05,390 --> 00:18:07,110
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

329
00:18:07,150 --> 00:18:09,050
like scattered ink.

330
00:18:09,930 --> 00:18:16,530
As destiny falls

331
00:18:12,770 --> 00:18:16,530
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

332
00:18:16,530 --> 00:18:24,130
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

333
00:18:19,770 --> 00:18:24,130
wither and melt into rivers.

334
00:18:24,570 --> 00:18:31,690
Who can deceive

335
00:18:27,330 --> 00:18:31,690
the law of the heavens ?

336
00:18:32,010 --> 00:18:35,010
Countless generations

337
00:18:33,290 --> 00:18:35,010
have tried before me.

338
00:18:35,300 --> 00:18:38,730
But how could I not catch my dreams

339
00:18:37,130 --> 00:18:38,730
within my warm fingers ?

340
00:18:39,290 --> 00:18:42,810
You're at my side when I'm alone

341
00:18:42,810 --> 00:18:46,130
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

342
00:18:46,890 --> 00:18:50,090
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

343
00:18:50,450 --> 00:18:54,290
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

344
00:18:52,290 --> 00:18:54,290
in the streets.

345
00:18:54,450 --> 00:18:59,250
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

346
00:18:56,010 --> 00:18:59,250
Can I break the rules ?

347
00:18:59,260 --> 00:19:01,970
To run towards you !

348
00:19:02,010 --> 00:19:05,290
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

349
00:19:05,290 --> 00:19:09,930
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

350
00:19:09,930 --> 00:19:13,330
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

351
00:19:13,370 --> 00:19:18,010
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

352
00:19:18,460 --> 00:19:23,690
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

353
00:19:23,810 --> 00:19:27,610
If your soul is willing to wander,

354
00:19:27,610 --> 00:19:32,250
can I still take your hands

355
00:19:29,290 --> 00:19:32,250
and hold them tight ?

356
00:19:32,410 --> 00:19:35,330
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

357
00:19:35,330 --> 00:19:40,210
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

358
00:19:40,220 --> 00:19:43,490
I dream of destroying

359
00:19:43,650 --> 00:19:48,210
the shackles of our fate.

360
00:19:48,210 --> 00:19:52,170
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

361
00:19:52,170 --> 00:19:54,970
You're the hardest to let go of.

362
00:19:55,050 --> 00:19:58,850
I want to be with you again

363
00:19:58,930 --> 00:20:02,210
so I can look in your eyes.

364
00:20:02,490 --> 00:20:07,450
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
